# OpenRC seat layer (OVERVIEW §8, init↔seat coupling).
# On OpenRC the seat/logind stack is elogind + seatd (systemd-logind is absent).
# Enable elogind/policykit integration and seatd's libseat backend so Wayland
# sessions (wm flavor) get a working seat without systemd.
sys-auth/elogind policykit
sys-auth/seatd builtin server
sys-auth/pambase elogind -systemd
